  "decisions": [
    "Do not attach additive/multiplicative group memberships to a bare ring or field carrier.",
    "Finite/full number-field adeles and ideles have separate objects; function fields include all places.",
    "Rational and integral quaternion objects are distinct; integral orders are not rational vector spaces.",
    "Symbolic F/K fields, algebras and views keep scalar embeddings explicit."
  ],
